  "ingredients": [
    "1.5 cups all-purpose flour",
    "0.75 teaspoon salt",
    "0.75 cup milk, room temperature",
    "3 large eggs, room temperature",
    "0.75 cup water",
    "0.5 cup beef drippings"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "To make the batter: Whisk flour and salt together in a large bowl; make a well in the center. Gradually whisk in milk until smooth. Beat in eggs, then whisk in water until light and frothy. Cover and let stand at room temperature for 1 hour, or refrigerate overnight.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/WpX6_u04f3YeOb0hsm6h-LTz5ys=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/9239-yorkshire-pudding-VAT-step-01-e1e2560393044ef3886bcc7a95e3c4db.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/9239/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cover and let stand at room temperature for 1 hour, or refrigerate overnight. Preheat the oven to 400 degrees F (205 degrees C).",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/H4dTE1gAXOxRL7KoC8_RyAtCyOo=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/9239-yorkshire-pudding-VAT-step-02-c99d1d9477b04f3893da68709f6ad619.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/9239/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Place 1 teaspoon beef drippings into each cup of a 12-cup muffin tin. Set the pan in the oven until the fat is very hot and sizzling, about 5 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/HtpHxqIGM6xbKvESIcvLvapfOb0=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/9239-yorkshire-pudding-VAT-step-03-628c0bc03ba44acf83dc19e49d57e0aa.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/9239/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Carefully remove the muffin tin from the oven. Whisk the batter briefly, then pour it evenly into the hot cups, filling each about two-thirds full.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/tZ2O0jiFpOkLA8RCLYmUnT6i4BM=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/9239-yorkshire-pudding-VAT-step-04-738273fc990d4154b21d7d1b51c8ee32.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/9239/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake until puffed and deep golden brown, 20 to 25 minutes. Do not open the oven door during baking. Serve immediately.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/Sic66kok77IqB94rk5sXCVY9Eqg=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/9239-yorkshire-pudding-VAT-step-05-927972f0d7d9444bb2ce301d6d89e526.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/9239/step_05.webp"
    }
